A `--step` naming no step of the playbook exits 1 with the step name and the known steps in the
error, and nothing on stdout.

-- fixtures/home/Claude/_playbooks/fx-unknown-step/playbook.md --
---
name: fx-unknown-step
title: Unknown Step
---

Preamble.
-- fixtures/home/Claude/_playbooks/fx-unknown-step/playbook.yaml --
graph:
  gather: []
-- fixtures/home/Claude/_playbooks/fx-unknown-step/gather/prompt.md --
---
name: gather
summary: Gather inputs.
---

Gather body.
-- cmd --
booping render-playbook fx-unknown-step --step nope
-- exit --
1
-- stdout --
-- stderr --
error: step not found in playbook 'fx-unknown-step': nope (known: gather)
